 "text": "Home - Jerauld County Sd\nshared.ada.skipToMainContent\nHome\nJerauld County History\nTeam\nAuditor\nGovernment\nHighway Department\nEqualization\n4-H\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff Office\nStates Attorney\nVeteran Services\nEmergency Management\nWelcome to Jerauld County SD\nWelcome\nThis county is centrally located in Southern Dakota, midway between the Missouri and Dakota rivers. It is divided near the center, north and south, by the Wessington hills, which extend entirely through the county. The plateau of the hills and the western slope are drained by two branches of Crow Creek, and the eastern portion by the Firesteel Creek.\nHome\nJerauld County History\nTeam\nAuditor\nGovernment\nHighway Department\nEqualization\n4-H\nTreasurer\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff Office\nStates Attorney\nVeteran Services\nEmergency Management\nAddress\n205 Wallace Ave S\nWessington Springs, SD 57382, US\nSitemap\nFollow us",
